  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 8.08,
      "e": 9.82,
      "text": "- We're teaching technical rescue"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.82,
      "e": 11.7,
      "text": "for fire fighters, rope rescue."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.73,
      "e": 14.04,
      "text": "The skill that they're learning right now"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.14,
      "e": 18.37,
      "text": "is how to repel down the system, pass a knot,"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.92,
      "e": 21.02,
      "text": "and then repel down all the way to the bottom."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.02,
      "e": 23.81,
      "text": "These principles teach people how to rescue somebody"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.81,
      "e": 26.92,
      "text": "if they're stranded on a rope or down a carabiner."
    },
    {
      "s": 27.07,
      "e": 28.12,
      "text": "- Don't grab the knot, let the knot go through your hand."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.12,
      "e": 29.12,
      "text": "- Your foot."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.03,
      "e": 30.86,
      "text": "- Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.86,
      "e": 32.27,
      "text": "- The biggest challenges for this training"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.27,
      "e": 33.58,
      "text": "are definitely the heights."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.58,
      "e": 35.44,
      "text": "Never really been super comfortable with heights,"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.44,
      "e": 37.89,
      "text": "but the instructors are really good."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.01,
      "e": 40.16,
      "text": "All my classmates are really good at encouraging each other."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.16,
      "e": 41.65,
      "text": "Everybody is like really positive out here."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.65,
      "e": 43.51,
      "text": "So you can pull on other people for strength"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.51,
      "e": 45.15,
      "text": "where you feel like you're a little weak"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.15,
      "e": 47.65,
      "text": "or where you feel like you struggle with certain things."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.35,
      "e": 52.01,
      "text": "- Some people they aren't as comfortable"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.01,
      "e": 54.69,
      "text": "going over the side of a ledge or a building."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.69,
      "e": 58.32,
      "text": "Having faith in your abilities to perform the rescue"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.32,
      "e": 60.33,
      "text": "in your equipment is crucial."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.74,
      "e": 66.26,
      "text": "- Rescue on the ground!"
    }
  ],
